{"slug":"bill-mccollum","qid":"Q862294","name":"Bill McCollum","desc":"American lawyer and politician (born 1944)","article":"Bill McCollum","born":"1944-07-12","died":null,"birthplace":"Brooksville","parties":["Republican Party"],"offices":[{"t":"Florida Attorney General","w":"","f":2007,"u":2011},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"FL-08","f":1993,"u":2001},{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"FL-05","f":1981,"u":1993}],"summary":"Ira William McCollum Jr. (born July 12, 1944) is an American politician who served as the 36th attorney general of Florida from 2007 to 2011 and in the United States House of Representatives from 1981 to 2001, representing Florida's 5th congressional district, which was  redistricted to the 8th congressional district in 1993. As a member of the House, McCollum rose to become Vice Chairman of the House Republican Conference, the fifth-highest ranking position in the House Republican leadership.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2000,"o":"S","k":"FL","p":"R","v":2705348,"s":46.19,"w":false,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1998,"o":"H","k":"FL-08","p":"R","v":104298,"s":65.77,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1996,"o":"H","k":"FL-08","p":"R","v":136515,"s":67.47,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1994,"o":"H","k":"FL-08","p":"R","v":131393,"s":99.67,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1992,"o":"H","k":"FL-08","p":"R","v":141977,"s":68.55,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1990,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":94453,"s":59.89,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1988,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":0,"s":null,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum","u":true},{"y":1986,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":0,"s":null,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum","u":true},{"y":1984,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":0,"s":null,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum","u":true},{"y":1982,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":69993,"s":58.79,"w":true,"n":"Bill McCollum"},{"y":1980,"o":"H","k":"FL-05","p":"R","v":177603,"s":55.76,"w":true,"n":"Bil McCollum"}]}